      a: "The Website Gallery is the main examples page for Website Support Studio. It shows sample homepage directions by industry so small-business owners can compare visual styles, messaging, service structures, and calls to action before requesting a custom preview.",
    },
    {
      q: "Are these finished client websites?",
      a: "No. These are sample concepts and fictional mockups, not finished client projects or performance claims. They show the kind of website direction Website Support Studio can adapt from a business brief.",
    },
    {
      q: "How should I use the Website Gallery?",
      a: "Choose the industry, tone, or layout closest to your business, then request a free website preview. Website Support Studio uses your services, service area, goals, and style preferences to prepare a custom direction.",
    },
  ]),
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Website Gallery Examples"
  description="Browse sample website directions for local businesses, professional services, medical offices, restaurants, retail, construction, and more."
  path="/website-gallery"
  image={DEFAULT_OG_IMAGE}
  schemas={schemas}
>
  <section class="gallery-hero" aria-labelledby="gallery-heading">
    <div class="container gallery-hero-grid">
      <div class="gallery-hero-copy">
        <p class="kicker"><Label text="_website_gallery" /></p>
        <h1 id="gallery-heading">See what your business could look like.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Browse browser-framed sample homepage ideas built to show how Website Support Studio can turn a local business into a polished, conversion-ready web presence.
        </p>
        <div class="gallery-hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-green btn-cta" href="/free-website-preview" data-ga-event="click_gallery_hero_preview">Get My Free Website Preview</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#gallery-grid" data-ga-event="click_gallery_browse">Browse Website Ideas</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <article class="featured-preview" aria-labelledby="featured-preview-heading">
        <div class="featured-meta">
          <span>Featured Preview</span>
          <strong>{featured.industry}</strong>
        </div>
        <div class={`site-frame site-frame--large mock-${featured.layout} palette-${featured.palette}`}>
          <div class="browser-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><em>{getPreviewDomain(featured)}</em></div>
          <div class="mock-site">
            <div class="mock-top">
              <strong>{featured.business}</strong>
              <nav aria-label={`${featured.business} sample navigation`}>
                {featured.nav.map((item) => <span>{item}</span>)}
              </nav>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-hero">
              <div>
                <p>{featured.style}</p>
                <h2 id="featured-preview-heading">{featured.headline}</h2>
                <span>{featured.cta}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-art" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-proof">
              <strong>{featured.proof}</strong>
              {featured.services.map((service) => <span>{service}</span>)}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gallery-section" aria-labelledby="gallery-grid-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="gallery-section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker"><Label text="_sample_homepage_ideas" /></p>
          <h2 id="gallery-grid-heading">Premium sample concepts across local industries.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          These are sample previews and mockups, not claims of finished client sites. They show the kind of polished homepage direction we can prepare from your business details.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gallery-answer-grid" aria-label="Website Gallery questions">
        <article>
          <h2>What is the Website Gallery?</h2>
          <p>
            The Website Gallery is the single examples page for Website Support Studio. It helps small-business owners compare sample website directions by industry, design style, service structure, proof points, and conversion path.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h2>Are these finished client websites?</h2>
          <p>
            No. These are sample concepts and fictional mockups, not finished client projects or performance claims. They show what a polished direction can look like before a custom preview is prepared from your business details.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h2>How should I use the Website Gallery?</h2>
          <p>
            Pick the industry, tone, or layout closest to your business, then request a free website preview. Website Support Studio adapts the direction around your services, service area, customer questions, and best next call to action.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="gallery-filters" aria-label="Filter website gallery">
        {filters.map((filter, index) => (
          <button type="button" class="gallery-filter" data-filter={filter} aria-pressed={index === 0 ? "true" : "false"}>
            {filter} <span>{getFilterCount(filter)}</span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="website-gallery-grid" id="gallery-grid">
        {galleryPreviews.map((preview) => (
          <article
            class="gallery-card"
            id={`preview-${preview.slug}`}
            data-category={preview.category}
            style={`--card-index:${galleryPreviews.indexOf(preview) % 7};`}
          >
            <div class={`gallery-browser palette-${preview.palette}`}>
              <div class="browser-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><em>{getPreviewDomain(preview)}</em></div>
              <div class="gallery-shot">
                <div class={`gallery-shot-fallback mock-${preview.layout} palette-${preview.palette}`} aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="mock-site">
                    <div class="mock-hero">
                      <div>
                        <p>{preview.style}</p>
                        <h3>{preview.headline}</h3>
                        <span>{preview.cta}</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="mock-art" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                {photoBySlug[preview.slug] && (
                  <img
                    class="gallery-photo"
                    src={photoBySlug[preview.slug].src}
                    alt={photoBySlug[preview.slug].alt}
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                )}
                <div class="gallery-shot-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="gallery-shot-top">
                  <strong>{preview.business}</strong>
                  <nav aria-label={`${preview.business} sample navigation`}>
                    {preview.nav.map((item) => <span>{item}</span>)}
                  </nav>
                </div>
                <div class="gallery-shot-copy">
                  <p>{preview.style}</p>
                  <h3>{preview.headline}</h3>
                  <span>{preview.cta}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="gallery-card-overlay">
                  {preview.demoHref && <a class="gallery-overlay-primary" href={preview.demoHref} data-ga-event="click_gallery_view_preview" data-ga-label={preview.slug}>View Preview</a>}
                  <a class="gallery-overlay-secondary" href={`/free-website-preview?industry=${encodeURIComponent(preview.industry)}&style=${encodeURIComponent(preview.business)}`} data-ga-event="click_gallery_request_like_this" data-ga-label={preview.slug}>Request One Like This</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-card-body">
              <div class="gallery-card-meta">
                <small>{preview.category}</small>
                <span>{preview.industry}</span>
              </div>
              <h3>{preview.business}</h3>
              <p>{getShortDescription(preview)}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gallery-cta" aria-labelledby="gallery-cta-heading">
    <div class="container gallery-cta-inner">
      <p class="kicker"><Label text="_ready_to_see_yours" /></p>
      <h2 id="gallery-cta-heading">Ready to see YOUR business?</h2>
      <p>
        Send your business details and we will prepare a custom preview direction built around your services, customers, and next best call to action.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-green btn-cta" href="/free-website-preview" data-ga-event="click_gallery_bottom_preview">Get My Free Website Preview</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const filterButtons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(".gallery-filter"));
    const galleryCards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(".gallery-card"));

    filterButtons.forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const filter = button.getAttribute("data-filter");
        filterButtons.forEach((item) => item.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(item === button)));
        galleryCards.forEach((card) => {
          const shouldShow = filter === "All" || card.getAttribute("data-category") === filter;
          card.toggleAttribute("hidden", !shouldShow);
        });
      });
    });
  </script>

  <style>
    .gallery-hero { padding:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,6.5rem) 0 clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem); background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#f7f8f5 100%); overflow:hidden; }
    .gallery-hero-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.86fr) minmax(360px,1.14fr); gap:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); align-items:center; }
    .gallery-hero-copy h1 { max-width:820px; margin:.55rem 0 0; font-size:clamp(2.45rem,6vw,5.35rem); line-height:.95; letter-spacing:0; overflow-wrap:normal; word-break:normal; hyphens:none; }
    .gallery-hero-copy .lede { max-width:62ch; margin-top:1rem; }
    .gallery-hero-actions,
    .gallery-card-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.65rem; align-items:center; }
    .gallery-hero-actions { margin-top:1.35rem; }
    .featured-preview { min-width:0; }
    .featured-meta { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; margin-bottom:.75rem; color:var(--text-muted); font-size:.85rem; font-weight:900; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; }
    .featured-meta strong { color:var(--text); letter-spacing:0; text-transform:none; font-size:.95rem; }
    .gallery-section { padding:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem) 0; background:var(--surface); font-family:Inter,"Avenir Next","Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif; letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-section-head { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(280px,.72fr); gap:1.5rem; align-items:end; margin-bottom:1.25rem; }
    .gallery-section-head h2 { margin:.35rem 0 0; max-width:13ch; font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.2rem); line-height:.96; letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-section-head p { margin:0; color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.65; }
    .gallery-answer-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; margin:1rem 0 1.25rem; }
    .gallery-answer-grid article { border:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,.1); border-radius:8px; padding:1rem; background:#fff; box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(11,18,32,.045); }
    .gallery-answer-grid h2 { margin:0; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-answer-grid p { margin:.6rem 0 0; color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.55; font-size:.93rem; }
    .gallery-filters { position:sticky; top:0; z-index:2; display:flex; gap:.5rem; overflow:auto; padding:.75rem 0 1rem; margin-bottom:.5rem; background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--surface) 72%,rgba(250,250,247,0)); scrollbar-width:none; }
    .gallery-filters::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
    .gallery-filter { flex:0 0 auto; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:999px; padding:.58rem .8rem; background:#fff; color:var(--text); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.82rem; font-weight:900; cursor:pointer; transition:background .2s ease,border-color .2s ease,color .2s ease,transform .2s ease; letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-filter span { opacity:.58; margin-left:.2rem; }
    .gallery-filter[aria-pressed="true"] { background:var(--ink); border-color:var(--ink); color:#fff; }
    .gallery-filter:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); }
    .website-gallery-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr)); gap:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.55rem); align-items:start; }
    .gallery-card { min-width:0; border:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,.1); border-radius:8px; background:#fff; box-shadow:0 18px 54px rgba(11,18,32,.06); overflow:hidden; transition:transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease, border-color .22s ease; }
    .gallery-card:hover { transform:translateY(-4px); border-color:rgba(11,18,32,.18); box-shadow:0 24px 62px rgba(11,18,32,.13); }
    .gallery-card[hidden] { display:none; }
    .gallery-browser { --accent:#35dcea; --deep:#0b1220; --soft:#eff6f2; --paper:#fff; background:#fff; }
    .gallery-shot { position:relative; height:238px; overflow:hidden; isolation:isolate; background:var(--soft); }
    .gallery-shot-fallback,
    .gallery-photo,
    .gallery-shot-shade,
    .gallery-card-overlay { position:absolute; inset:0; }
    .gallery-shot-fallback { z-index:0; }
    .gallery-shot-fallback .mock-site { min-height:100%; height:100%; padding:.7rem; }
    .gallery-shot-fallback .mock-hero { min-height:100%; margin:0; }
    .gallery-shot-fallback .mock-proof,
    .gallery-shot-fallback .mock-top { display:none; }
    .gallery-photo { z-index:1; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
    .gallery-shot-shade { z-index:2; background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,18,32,.34),rgba(11,18,32,.06) 36%,rgba(11,18,32,.78)); }
    .gallery-shot-top { position:absolute; z-index:3; top:.9rem; left:1rem; right:1rem; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:.75rem; color:#fff; text-shadow:0 1px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
    .gallery-shot-top strong { min-width:0; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.72rem; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-shot-top nav { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:flex-end; gap:.45rem; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.56rem; font-weight:800; color:rgba(255,255,255,.86); letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-shot-copy { position:absolute; z-index:3; left:1rem; right:1rem; bottom:1rem; color:#fff; text-shadow:0 1px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.42); }
    .gallery-shot-copy p { margin:0 0 .35rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,.84); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.62rem; font-weight:900; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; }
    .gallery-shot-copy h3 { margin:0; max-width:24rem; color:#fff; font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.65rem); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-shot-copy span { display:inline-flex; max-width:100%; margin-top:.72rem; border-radius:999px; padding:.5rem .72rem; background:var(--accent); color:#071017; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.7rem; font-weight:950; line-height:1.2; text-shadow:none; }
    .gallery-card-overlay { z-index:4; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; justify-content:center; align-content:center; gap:.65rem; padding:1rem; background:rgba(11,18,32,.58); opacity:0; pointer-events:none; backdrop-filter:blur(2px); transition:opacity .2s ease; }
    .gallery-card:hover .gallery-card-overlay,
    .gallery-card:focus-within .gallery-card-overlay { opacity:1; pointer-events:auto; }
    .gallery-card-overlay a { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:2.65rem; border-radius:999px; padding:.72rem 1rem; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.76rem; font-weight:900; line-height:1.15; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; transition:transform .16s ease; }
    .gallery-card-overlay a:hover { transform:scale(1.04); text-decoration:none; }
    .gallery-overlay-primary { background:var(--brand-amber); color:var(--text-strong); }
    .gallery-overlay-secondary { border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.78); color:#fff; background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
    .gallery-card-body { display:grid; gap:.45rem; padding:.85rem 1rem 1rem; }
    .gallery-card-meta { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:.38rem; }
    .gallery-card-meta span,
    .gallery-card-meta small { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; border-radius:999px; font-family:var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-card-meta span { border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 34%,#fff); padding:.25rem .55rem; background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 12%,#fff); color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 72%,#111); font-size:.7rem; font-weight:950; }
    .gallery-card-meta small { order:-1; color:var(--text-muted); background:#f4f2ec; padding:.22rem .5rem; font-size:.66rem; font-weight:850; }
    .gallery-card-body h3 { margin:0; font-size:1.02rem; line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:0; }
    .gallery-card-body p { display:-webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp:2; -webkit-box-orient:vertical; min-height:2.8em; margin:0; color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.4; font-size:.9rem; overflow:hidden; }
    .gallery-card-actions .btn { flex:1 1 150px; justify-content:center; min-height:2.55rem; padding-inline:.85rem; white-space:normal; text-align:center; }
    .site-frame { --accent:#35dcea; --deep:#0b1220; --soft:#eff6f2; --paper:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,.13); border-radius:8px; background:#fff; box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.72); overflow:hidden; }
    .site-frame--large { box-shadow:0 32px 100px rgba(11,18,32,.16); }
    .browser-bar { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.36rem; height:2rem; padding:0 .75rem; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,.09); background:#f8faf7; }
    .browser-bar span { width:.55rem; height:.55rem; border-radius:999px; background:#d7ded8; }
    .browser-bar span:first-child { background:#f06b5f; }
    .browser-bar span:nth-child(2) { background:#f7c34f; }
    .browser-bar span:nth-child(3) { background:#57c779; }
    .browser-bar em { min-width:0; margin-left:.35rem; color:rgba(11,18,32,.55); font-size:.69rem; font-style:normal; font-weight:850; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; }
    .mock-site { min-height:300px; padding:.85rem; background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 82% 18%, color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 34%,transparent), transparent 28%),
      linear-gradient(135deg,var(--paper),var(--soft)); color:var(--deep); }
    .site-frame--large .mock-site { min-height:470px; padding:1.2rem; }
    .mock-top { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:.8rem; }
    .mock-top strong { font-size:.88rem; letter-spacing:0; }
    .mock-top nav { display:flex; gap:.45rem; color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--deep) 68%,#fff); font-size:.58rem; font-weight:900; }
    .mock-hero { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(86px,.78fr); gap:.8rem; align-items:center; min-height:155px; margin-top:.85rem; }
    .site-frame--large .mock-hero { min-height:265px; }
    .mock-hero p { margin:0 0 .38rem; color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 70%,var(--deep)); font-size:.58rem; font-weight:950; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; }
    .mock-hero h2,
    .mock-hero h3 { margin:0; max-width:100%; font-size:clamp(1.15rem,1.65vw,1.65rem); line-height:1.04; letter-spacing:0; overflow-wrap:normal; word-break:normal; hyphens:none; }
    .site-frame--large .mock-hero h2 { font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.1vw,3.2rem); line-height:1; }
    .mock-hero span { display:inline-flex; width:max-content; max-width:100%; margin-top:.65rem; border-radius:999px; padding:.48rem .65rem; background:var(--accent); color:#071017; font-size:.68rem; font-weight:950; }
    .mock-art { position:relative; min-height:130px; border-radius:8px; background:
      linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 78%,#fff),color-mix(in srgb,var(--deep) 88%,#fff));
      overflow:hidden; }
    .site-frame--large .mock-art { min-height:230px; }
    .mock-art i { position:absolute; display:block; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.68); }
    .mock-art i:first-child { width:58%; height:58%; right:-16%; top:-10%; }
    .mock-art i:nth-child(2) { width:36%; height:70%; left:10%; bottom:-22%; border-radius:8px; }
    .mock-art i:nth-child(3) { width:46%; height:12%; right:14%; bottom:18%; border-radius:999px; }
    .mock-proof { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.35fr repeat(3,1fr); gap:.5rem; margin-top:.8rem; }
    .mock-proof strong,
    .mock-proof span { min-width:0; border:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,.08); border-radius:8px; padding:.55rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size:.62rem; font-weight:900; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; }
    .mock-proof strong { color:var(--deep); }
    .mock-proof span { color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--deep) 72%,#fff); }
    .mock-impact .mock-hero,
    .mock-luxury .mock-hero,
    .mock-industrial .mock-hero { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .mock-impact .mock-art,
    .mock-luxury .mock-art,
    .mock-industrial .mock-art { min-height:90px; }
    .mock-dashboard .mock-hero { grid-template-columns:1fr .9fr; align-items:start; }
    .mock-dashboard .mock-art { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:.4rem; padding:.5rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,.54); }
    .mock-dashboard .mock-art i { position:static; width:auto; height:auto; min-height:45px; border-radius:8px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),rgba(255,255,255,.72)); }
    .mock-grid .mock-proof { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    .mock-editorial .mock-hero { grid-template-columns:.78fr 1fr; }
    .mock-minimal .mock-site { background:#fff; }
    .mock-minimal .mock-art { background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--soft),#fff); border:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,.08); }
    .mock-product .mock-art { border-radius:999px 999px 8px 8px; }
    .mock-collage .mock-art { clip-path:polygon(8% 0,100% 10%,92% 100%,0 88%); }
    .mock-service .mock-proof { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .mock-service .mock-proof span,
    .mock-service .mock-proof strong { white-space:normal; }
    .palette-verdant { --accent:#6dbf4b; --deep:#19351f; --soft:#eef6e8; --paper:#fffdf4; }
    .palette-steel { --accent:#f4b142; --deep:#17202c; --soft:#e9edf2; --paper:#fff; }
    .palette-frost { --accent:#35dcea; --deep:#10293d; --soft:#eaf8fb; --paper:#fff; }
    .palette-voltage { --accent:#ffd33d; --deep:#151515; --soft:#f7f2de; --paper:#fff; }
    .palette-water { --accent:#3bb4e5; --deep:#12334c; --soft:#e8f6fb; --paper:#fbffff; }
    .palette-clay { --accent:#d37b52; --deep:#33231d; --soft:#fbefe8; --paper:#fff9f4; }
    .palette-forest { --accent:#7aa66a; --deep:#1c2e22; --soft:#eef4ec; --paper:#fffdf5; }
    .palette-pearl { --accent:#79d7d5; --deep:#24333d; --soft:#edf9f8; --paper:#fff; }
    .palette-mint { --accent:#8be6bd; --deep:#143c3a; --soft:#effbf5; --paper:#fff; }
    .palette-navy { --accent:#c8a45d; --deep:#0e1d34; --soft:#eef2f8; --paper:#fff; }
    .palette-sage { --accent:#8aa38f; --deep:#17241f; --soft:#f1f5ef; --paper:#fff; }
